  "faq": {
    "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "subtitle": "Still have questions? Ask AI directly in the input box above",
    "q1": "Is Tellcraft suitable for people without coding experience?",
    "a1": "Absolutely. Tellcraft's core philosophy is enabling anyone to complete software development through conversation. You just need to clearly describe what features you want, and AI handles all technical details. The entire process is as natural as chatting with a friend.",
    "q2": "How is the generated code quality? Can I modify it myself?",
    "a2": "Tellcraft generates code following industry best practices, using mainstream tech stacks like Next.js, React, and TypeScript. You have 100% code ownership and can export the full source code anytime to modify yourself or hand over to engineers for maintenance.",
    "q3": "What if my requirements are complex?",
    "a3": "AI will gradually clarify your requirements through multiple rounds of conversation. Even complex systems will be broken down into executable small specifications. If a requirement exceeds current capabilities, AI will clearly inform you and suggest alternatives.",
    "q4": "Can I modify the website after it goes live?",
    "a4": "Of course. You can come back anytime and describe modification needs through conversation. AI will understand the existing system architecture and make precise changes. Minor modifications usually only require a few lines of conversation.",
    "q5": "Is the data safe? Do you access my user data?",
    "a5": "Your application data is stored in an independent database. Tellcraft does not access or analyze your user data. We only process conversation content during development, and all communications are encrypted.",
    "q6": "What happens to my website if I want to cancel the service?",
    "a6": "You can export the complete source code and database at any time and deploy to other platforms on your own. We won't lock your data or code. After cancellation, there's a 30-day grace period for migration.",
    "q7": "How is Tellcraft different from other no-code tools?",
    "a7": "Traditional no-code tools are limited to preset templates and features. Tellcraft actually generates custom code with no feature ceiling. You get a complete application, not a half-finished product limited by the platform.",
    "q8": "What types of websites or applications are supported?",
    "a8": "Currently supports web applications, including: e-commerce websites, SaaS platforms, admin dashboards, membership systems, booking systems, etc. Native mobile apps are not yet supported, but mobile-friendly web apps can be built."
  },
